sequenceDiagram
    participant UA as User A
    participant CDN
    participant Origin
    participant UB as User B
    UA->>CDN: 1. get image.png
    Note over CDN: not in cache
    CDN->>Origin: 2. get image.png from server
    Origin-->>CDN: 3. store image.png + TTL
    CDN-->>UA: 4. return image.png
    UB->>CDN: 5. get image.png
    Note over CDN: cache hit (TTL not expired)
    CDN-->>UB: 6. return image.png
